{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばんです。\n生駒ちゃんです！\nヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日プリンシパルの稽古やったよ！\nいろいろスイッチ入って来たよ！ｷﾀ━(ﾟ∀ﾟ)━!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演も頑張るぞ！\n新曲披露もあるから見なきゃそん！\nそんそそんそんそそそんそんそんそーんそそん((´∀｀))\nあーダンス楽しい！\nもっと綺麗な形に仕上げなきゃ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで！\n5月25日は生駒ちゃんの推しのなぁちゃんのお誕生日でした！\nなぁちゃんおめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんはまずかわいい！\nそしてかわいくてかわいい！\nそれとかわいい！やべぇかわいい！\nかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいいかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/27/6137675/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/r